   "text": "1  AUTHORITATIVE DNS for dc4pay.com\nThe one official phone book for every name\nunder dc4pay.com. It is at Cloudflare because\nyou registered the domain there.\nRecord:  api  CNAME  <tunnel-id>.cfargotunnel.com",
   "originalText": "1  AUTHORITATIVE DNS for dc4pay.com\nThe one official phone book for every name\nunder dc4pay.com. It is at Cloudflare because\nyou registered the domain there.\nRecord:  api  CNAME  <tunnel-id>.cfargotunnel.com",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "authdns",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 100.4,
