   "text": "2  CLOUDFLARE EDGE = the Cloudflare data\ncentre nearest the visitor (Amsterdam for you).\nTLS TERMINATES here: the padlock/encryption\nthe browser set up is with Cloudflare's\ncertificate, and is decrypted at this point.",
