   "text": "3/4  cloudflared = a small program\nrunning as a pod in your cluster.\nAt start-up it OPENS a connection\nOUTBOUND to Cloudflare and keeps\nit open. That connection IS the tunnel.",
   "originalText": "3/4  cloudflared = a small program\nrunning as a pod in your cluster.\nAt start-up it OPENS a connection\nOUTBOUND to Cloudflare and keeps\nit open. That connection IS the tunnel.",
